        {
          "type": "final",
          "verdict": "findings_remain",
          "findings": [
            {
              "message": "`infrastructure::codex_common::resolve_codex_runtime` の `docs` が「repo-local を先に probe し、その後 PATH fallback」という IN-03/CN-02/CN-03 の挙動を再記述しています。`knowledge/conventions/no-upstream-restatement.md` に従い、変更対象と anchor 参照だけにしてください。",
              "severity": "P1",
              "file": "track/items/codex-resolve-and-link-provisioning-2026-07-18/infrastructure-types.json",
              "line": 6,
              "category": "SoT integrity"
            },
            {
              "message": "`infrastructure::codex_common::resolve_codex_runtime` は保持しない `project_root` を `PathBuf` で所有権移動させるため、呼び出し側に不要な clone を強制します。read-only resolver の引数は `&std::path::Path` にしてください。",
              "severity": "P1",
              "file": "track/items/codex-resolve-and-link-provisioning-2026-07-18/infrastructure-types.json",
              "line": 12,
              "category": "API shape"
            },
            {
              "message": "`infrastructure::ResolvedCodexRuntime` の `&self` accessor 4件が `OsString`、`Option<PathBuf>`、`PathBuf`、`String` を所有値で返し、参照だけで足りる利用にも clone/allocation を強制します。各戻り値を `&OsStr`、`Option<&Path>`、`&Path`、`&str` として宣言してください。",
              "severity": "P1",
              "file": "track/items/codex-resolve-and-link-provisioning-2026-07-18/infrastructure-types.json",
              "line": 66,
              "category": "API shape"
            },
            {
              "message": "`infrastructure::FsCodexRuntimeProvisioner` の `docs` が「解決・probe 後に link を作る」という IN-01/AC-01 の順序契約を再記述しています。`knowledge/conventions/no-upstream-restatement.md` に従い、変更対象と anchor 参照だけにしてください。",
              "severity": "P1",
              "file": "track/items/codex-resolve-and-link-provisioning-2026-07-18/infrastructure-types.json",
              "line": 547,
              "category": "SoT integrity"
            },
            {
              "message": "`usecase::CodexRuntimeProvisionPort::provision` は filesystem、npm、subprocess I/O を担う port なのに同期メソッドとして宣言され、`docs` に blocking を選ぶ理由もありません。async 境界にするか、同期実行を意図した契約として明記し、`CodexRuntimeProvisionService` 側も同じ実行色に揃えてください。",
              "severity": "P1",
              "file": "track/items/codex-resolve-and-link-provisioning-2026-07-18/usecase-types.json",
              "line": 101,
              "category": "API shape"
            }
          ],
          "hash": "rvw1:sha256:b12859626adb3a1e6c8d1747b9b38794c392266475b444265bcdeac4b2c6ca41",
          "at": "2026-07-18T07:25:38Z"
        },
        {
          "type": "fast",
          "verdict": "findings_remain",
          "findings": [
            {
              "message": "The `CodexRuntimeProvisionPort::provision` and `CodexRuntimeProvisionService::provision` declarations take `project_root: std::path::PathBuf` by value even though the operation only needs to use the repository path as a location and the infrastructure resolver already accepts `&std::path::Path`. This needlessly transfers ownership across the usecase boundary and forces callers to clone or relinquish a path; declare a borrowed path (`&std::path::Path`) unless the contract explicitly requires ownership.",
              "severity": "P1",
              "file": "track/items/codex-resolve-and-link-provisioning-2026-07-18/usecase-types.json",
              "line": 106,
              "category": "ownership signature smell"
            }
          ],
          "hash": "rvw1:sha256:9f98a58921eae558a18b72b337fe0f78b12db9d572cd1495e9029b6bb93b7bc7",
          "at": "2026-07-18T07:37:06Z"
